sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>Next.js :3000
    participant API as FastAPI<br/>:5055
    participant CQ as Command Queue<br/>surreal-commands
    participant CC as content-core<br/>Extraction
    participant EMB as Embedding Provider<br/>Esperanto
    participant DB as SurrealDB<br/>:8000
    participant LLM as LLM Provider<br/>Esperanto

    Note over User,LLM: Source Ingestion + Chat Flow

    User->>FE: Upload file / paste URL
    FE->>API: POST /api/sources (multipart)
    API->>DB: Create Source record (pending)
    API->>CQ: Enqueue process_source_command
    API-->>FE: { source_id, status: "processing" }

    CQ->>CC: extract_content(file/url)
    CC-->>CQ: { full_text, metadata }
    CQ->>DB: Update Source (full_text)
    CQ->>EMB: embed_batch(chunks[])
    EMB-->>CQ: vectors[]
    CQ->>DB: Store SourceEmbedding records
    CQ->>DB: Mark Source status = ready

    User->>FE: Send chat message
    FE->>API: POST /api/chat { message, notebook_id }
    API->>DB: Load context (sources + notes)
    API->>LLM: ainvoke(system + history + message)
    LLM-->>API: AI response
    API->>DB: Persist message history (SQLite)
    API-->>FE: { response }
    FE->>FE: Render response in UI
